<div class="row">
  <div class="col-lg-8 mx-auto">
    <div class="card shadow-sm">
      <div class="card-header bg-primary text-white">
        <h4 class="mb-0">
          <i class="bi bi-upload"></i> Upload Email File
        </h4>
      </div>
      <div class="card-body">
        <p class="text-muted">
          Upload a <code>.eml</code> file to process customer information. 
          The file will be processed in the background and results will appear in the Processing Logs.
        </p>

        <%= form_with url: uploads_path, method: :post, multipart: true, class: "mt-4" do |f| %>
          <div class="mb-3">
            <label for="email_file" class="form-label fw-bold">Select .eml file</label>
            <input type="file" 
                   class="form-control" 
                   id="email_file" 
                   name="email_file" 
                   accept=".eml"
                   required>
            <div class="form-text">Only .eml (email) files are accepted</div>
          </div>

          <div class="d-grid gap-2">
            <%= f.submit "Upload and Process", class: "btn btn-primary btn-lg" %>
          </div>
        <% end %>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="card mt-4 shadow-sm">
      <div class="card-header">
        <h5 class="mb-0">
          <i class="bi bi-info-circle"></i> How it works
        </h5>
      </div>
      <div class="card-body">
        <ol class="mb-0">
          <li>Upload a <code>.eml</code> file using the form above</li>
          <li>The system will identify the sender and select the appropriate parser</li>
          <li>Customer information (name, email, phone, product code) will be extracted</li>
          <li>A new customer record will be created if extraction is successful</li>
          <li>All processing attempts are logged (success or failure)</li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="card mt-4 shadow-sm">
      <div class="card-header">
        <h5 class="mb-0">
          <i class="bi bi-check-circle"></i> Supported Senders
        </h5>
      </div>
      <div class="card-body">
        <ul class="mb-0">
          <li><strong>Fornecedor A:</strong> <code>loja@fornecedorA.com</code></li>
          <li><strong>Parceiro B:</strong> <code>contato@parceiroB.com</code></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
